-   entry .Units   the unit an `<svg>` element's `width` and `height` carry: `Em`, `Ex`, `Px`, `In`, `Cm`, `Mm`, `Pt`, `Pc` or `Percent`
-       Each case's `suffix` is the text written after the number: `mm`, `%`. An `Svg` with
-       `unit = Unset` writes bare numbers, which SVG reads as user units. Named `Units` rather
-       than `Unit`, which would shadow `scala.Unit`.
