- entry .unary_+   a tuple of two numbers as a `Delta`: `+(3, 4)` is `Delta(3, 4)`
-     An extension on any pair of numeric types, so a displacement can be written without the
-     constructor: `rectangle.translate(+(3, 4))`.
+ entry .unary_+   2 つの数の組を `Delta` として：`+(3, 4)` は `Delta(3, 4)`
